{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07006","headline":"乘潮至渔浦作 · 陶翰","name":"乘潮至渔浦作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"舣棹乘早潮，潮来如风雨。\n樟台忽已隐，界峯莫及覩。\n崩腾心爲失，浩荡目无主。\n豗𢟸浪始闻，漾漾入鱼浦\n云景共澄霁，江山相吞吐。\n伟哉造化工，此事从终古。\n流沫诚足诫，商歌调易苦。\n颇因忠信全，客心犹栩栩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶翰","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_07006.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_07006","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}